expect Puzzle complete with 1 hint. New game is in More.
clean
shot sudoku-completed
# A full board takes no more digits or notes.
tap-id cell-80
tap-id digit-1
expect Puzzle complete with 1 hint.
tap-id pencil
tap-id digit-1
expect Puzzle complete with 1 hint.
tap-id pencil
# Nothing is lost by moving on, so New game does not warn.
tap-id game-more
tap-id game-new
expect Choose a difficulty.
expect-missing Replaces this game
clean
shot sudoku-completed-new-game
tap Keep playing
# The finished board is still finished after a restart.
restart
wait-for Puzzle complete with 1 hint.
clean
shot sudoku-completed-resumed
# A stray Erase should not reopen a finished puzzle either; the digits and
# Notes already refuse to change it.
tap-id cell-80
tap-id erase
expect Puzzle complete with 1 hint.
expect-missing 1 left
